## PCF8575 root cause
Short matrix (drive one pin low): no consistent followers -> no wire shorts. Pins read HIGH right after write, decay within ~20 ms -> no pull-up holding them.
Chip marking: PCF8575CTS -> PCF8575C (open-drain P-ports, no internal pull-up, VCC 4.5-5.5V).
Module: Open-Smart, VCC -> AMS1117-3.3 (unverified) -> VDD. With 3.3V on VCC, chip VDD likely ~2.2V.
Fix plan: 3V3 to VDD (or bridge VCC-VDD pad), add 16x 10k pull-ups P00-P17 to 3V3. Never 5V on VCC (SDA/SCL pulled to VCC).

